The MTP draft takes the target's model, model_weights and hf_config_path.

For --speculative-config method "mtp" without a model of its own,
SpeculativeConfig sets `model` to the target's model_weights, or to its model
when model_weights is empty, and builds the draft ModelConfig with that path
as model. The gguf plugin gives a GGUF target two sources: model is the config
directory (--hf-config-path, the hfconfig/ directory beside the file) and
model_weights is the .gguf file. The draft ModelConfig got the .gguf file as
its model. With no config.json beside the file the boot stops at
"Unrecognized model"; with one, at the image processor lookup
(get_hf_image_processor_config), where huggingface_hub rejects the file path
as a repo id (HFValidationError).

When the method is "mtp" and the draft path is the target's, the draft
ModelConfig now takes the target's model, model_weights and hf_config_path as
they are. For a target whose model_weights is empty, model is the same path as
before and model_weights stays empty; the draft reads its config from the
target's hf_config_path when one is set. A runai_streamer target (model the
pulled local directory, model_weights the object-storage URI) hands both on
the same way. Every other method is unchanged.

Cut against stock 0.29.0: of the series above only dflash2-backport.patch
touches config/speculative.py, and the install skips it.

--- a/config/speculative.py
+++ b/config/speculative.py
@@ -1235,8 +1235,24 @@
                     draft_hf_overrides = SpeculativeConfig.compose_draft_hf_overrides(
                         self.target_model_config.hf_overrides
                     )
+                # MTP from the target's own checkpoint: the draft takes the
+                # target's config source and weight source as they are. For a
+                # GGUF target they differ: a config directory and the .gguf file.
+                draft_is_target = self.method == "mtp" and self.model == (
+                    self.target_model_config.model_weights
+                    or self.target_model_config.model
+                )
                 self.draft_model_config = ModelConfig(
-                    model=self.model,
+                    model=(
+                        self.target_model_config.model
+                        if draft_is_target
+                        else self.model
+                    ),
+                    model_weights=(
+                        self.target_model_config.model_weights
+                        if draft_is_target
+                        else ""
+                    ),
                     runner="draft",
                     tokenizer=(
                         self.model
@@ -1259,6 +1275,11 @@
                     max_logprobs=self.target_model_config.max_logprobs,
                     hf_overrides=draft_hf_overrides,
                     config_format=self.target_model_config.config_format,
+                    hf_config_path=(
+                        self.target_model_config.hf_config_path
+                        if draft_is_target
+                        else None
+                    ),
                 )
 
